          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What is Section 148A?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Mandatory pre-notice procedure (Finance Act 2021). AO must: issue SCN with information, give 7-30 days for reply, pass reasoned order deciding whether to issue 148. Safeguard ensuring taxpayer is heard first."
          }
        },
