svg>Defended</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="20" y="15" width="80" height="50" rx="6" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5"/><text x="60" y="40" font-size="8" fill="#14365F" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">148</text></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Objected</span><span class="step-number-large">02</span></div></div></div><div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Stage 3</span><h3 class="step-title">Appeal + Stay + Writ (if needed)</h3><p class="step-description">If reassessment order makes additions: CIT(A) appeal within 30 days + stay on 20%. If notice is procedurally defective: writ petition support for High Court quashing. Track through to resolution.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Appeal/writ filed</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Resolved</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="20" y="10" width="80" height="60" rx="8" fill="#E8F5E9" stroke="#25D366" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M52 40l5 5 12-12" stroke="#25D366" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Resolved</span><span class="step-number-large">03</span></div></div></div>

